[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952496943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107259#issuecomment-2952496943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107259","id":2952496943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v-4cv","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T13:35:25Z","updated_at":"2025-06-07T13:38:18Z","body":"This doesn't look like a bug, you're duplicating the material and then it gets deleted because you don't save it, try:\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nconst mat_preload: Material = preload(\"res://material.tres\")\nvar mat_dupl: Material\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tmat_dupl = mat_preload.duplicate()\n\tvar preload_ci_rid: RID = RenderingServer.canvas_item_create()\n\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_parent(preload_ci_rid, get_canvas_item())\n\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_set_material(preload_ci_rid, mat_dupl.get_rid())\n\tRenderingServer.canvas_item_add_rect(preload_ci_rid, Rect2(100, 100, 100, 100), Color.RED)\n```\n\nThe duplicated material gets deleted at the end of the function otherwise, as it's reference counted\n\nEdit: Confirmed that yes, this is not a bug and works correctly if you save the materials","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952496943/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2952512784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107259#issuecomment-2952512784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107259","id":2952512784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6v-8UQ","user":{"login":"dmitrijbes","id":15231915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjMxOTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15231915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrijbes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrijbes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-07T13:51:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-07T13:55:03Z","body":"You're absolutely right!\nI have spent like 4 hr yesterday, trying to understand why this simple code won't work.\nIt is such a trivial mistake!\nI thought that Renderi